   "source": [
    "2] Modifying the existing  feature\n",
    "Example 1: Encoding Categorical Data\n",
    "📌 Original Feature:\n",
    "Color = Red, Blue, Green\n",
    "⚙️ Modified Feature:\n",
    "Red → 1\n",
    "Blue → 2\n",
    "Green → 3\n",
    "\n",
    "👉 Converts text into numeric form.\n",
    "Example 2] Unit Conversion\n",
    "📌 Original Feature:\n",
    "Height = 170 cm\n",
    "⚙️ Modified Feature:\n",
    "Height = 1.70 m\n",
    "\n",
    "👉 Same data, different unit.\n"
   ]
  }
